"P1793866907" "You learned about shunting between Night Ward and First Ward."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1290851714" "I gather that it worked?<br><br>That pleases me greatly. I have labored long and hard to develop this method of travel between these realms. I look forward to exploring Night Ward myself, but first I have a few personal effects to gather. You never know what you'll need in the Netherworld until you are there and realize you forgot something important, like food.<br><br>Thank you for all of your help, {HeroName}, and, keep the spell. It's my gift to you for helping me prove that my magical research is sound and that my spell works."
// RandomFameString :
"P529201754" "Ugh... got a chill all of a sudden, like an icy hand touched my shoulder... weird."
